{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "5d720ea4-6a11-819c-b995-1de133c9daa2",
  "created_at": "2025-12-11T11:41:57-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Rocco Grasso",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tony Ferreira",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:38:44-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Tony. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:38:48-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, hello. My name is Rocco Grasso. I get my water and sewer bill and I see the reading is estimated. Estimated, not real. This is annoying me, honestly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:38:59-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I hear you. Let me pull it up. Is that for the house you own, Mr. Grasso?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:39:06-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I am the homeowner. And I am not asking you to change it, okay? I only want somebody to explain me why it says estimated."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:39:16-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, that's easy enough. An estimated read just means the meter wasn't read by the crew or by the remote device that cycle, so the bill is based on your past usage instead. Then a real read comes along and it evens out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:39:31-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. But the meter, it is in the crawlspace under the house. Nobody goes in there. Nobody. Not me, not the city. So how they read it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:39:41-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, that's likely your answer. If the meter's somewhere the reader can't get to, it goes estimated. Some of them have an outside reader hooked up to them, and some don't. Yours looks like it doesn't have one that's reporting."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:39:55-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So the estimate, it is because of the crawlspace. I understand correct?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:40:00-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's the most likely reason, yes. When a real read finally gets in, the next bill adjusts up or down to match what you actually used."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:40:10-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And the little bit I pay now, it is not wrong, it is only a guess."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:40:17-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, a guess based on your history. Not a penalty or anything like that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:40:23-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hm. Fine. Another thing. My mother lives with us, she is seventy-eight. Is there any discount for low income or for elderly people? On the water?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:40:33-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good question. I don't have a senior discount listed on my screen for water and sewer. I can transfer you over to the water division office and they can tell you if there's any assistance program. Or I can take your number and have them call you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:40:50-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Please, take the number. Is four zero one, five five five, zero one five one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:40:56-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-five-one. Got it. And it's under Grasso, G-R-A-S-S-O?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:41:00-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, correct. Two S, two... no, one S, then another S. Grasso. Yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:41:05-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, Grasso. I'll put the note in about the senior discount question and the crawlspace meter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:41:12-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. One more thing. I call before to the water office and the line is closed. A man said the district posted a new schedule for the winter break. You know this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:41:24-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I do hear the schedule shifts a bit around the holidays. I'd check what's posted on the city's site before you plan to stop by, since I don't want to give you the wrong hours."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:41:37-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I look there. So, to confirm: the bill is estimated, because the meter is in crawlspace, and somebody will call me about discount."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:41:46-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You got it exactly. Anything else I can do for you today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:41:51-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that is all. Thank you, Tony."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:41:54-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Grasso. Take care."
    }
  ],
